  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_018 (multimodal, multiprofile, scgpt, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) achieved 52% accuracy. This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 (a lighter CNN) while keeping other components identical, to assess if image encoder choice impacts performance. It clarifies whether the previous ViT-based encoder was optimal, with lower expected cost (resnet50 is cheaper than ViT). This balances exploitation (building on multimodal/multiprofile success) and exploration (testing a different image encoder)."
